Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,博士日志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor's log.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是在波托贝罗炼狱的第243天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's day 243 in this... Portobello purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:02:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一的伙伴是一块"我叫石头"的石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only companion is a rock I named stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.38,0:02:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,问题是, 我在跟谁讲我的这些事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, for whom am I narrating this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我成了荒诞派对的主角\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems I've become a featured player in the theater of the absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,被那只可怜的蓝色啮齿动物(索尼克)困在这个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marooned in deep space by that wretched blue rodent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.11,0:02:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但这一切都还好, 多亏了这和谐的氛围和我超群的智商,\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's all good, thanks to a breathable atmosphere and my supreme intellect,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,正与唯一一位精明的竞争对手较量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharpened against the only competitor savvy enough to bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:25.61,Note,,0,0,0,,(蘑菇菌"D4"开局)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在努力让蘑菇菌成为首选功能性饮料之…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been striving to make fungi into a functional drink of choice...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.10,0:02:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,蘑菇咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mushroom coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.29,0:02:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,用有限的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With limited...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.78,0:02:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Limited...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,有限的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Limited...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,直至成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Success.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,但今天, 第243天,\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today, day 243,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一天天的努力有了新得转机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has brought a new optimism to my most pressing endeavor...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.26,0:02:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我的发明能将我从这颗行星踢到另一颗行星(我终于能回地球了)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Planetus exodus to returnicus and kick blue butticus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我的计算无误,\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my calculations are correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.40,0:03:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没有"如果", 而是一定会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's no reason to say "if" because they always are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.52,0:03:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这根羽毛笔将是能量得关键.\N{\fnArial\fs30}This quill is going to power my masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.61,0:03:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在点燃这根"蜡烛"…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's light this candle...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,看看谁来"敲门"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see who comes a-knockin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨!!!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.63,0:04:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉图·巴拉达·尼克托(一首歌的歌名)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaatu barada nikto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,特工石头? 就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent stone? Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.21,0:05:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了, 石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候向这片"狗屎"蘑菇星球说再见了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to say goodbye to this piece-of-shiitake planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西你从哪儿弄来的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,一个来自地球的可怕的蓝色家伙身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a little blue menace on the planet called earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我很乐意为你指路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be happy to show you the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.35,0:05:53.31,Title,,0,0,0,,《刺猬索尼克2》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,警察还跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.89,0:06:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这能让他们减速\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll slow 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小心. 打扰一下. 抱歉. 来了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out. Excuse me. Pardon me. Coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上好, 先生们, 介意我开车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, gentlemen. Mind if I drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.86,0:06:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,最好系好安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better buckle up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在后面怎么样啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we doing back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,现在往这边拐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 抱歉, 我不知道胶带还贴着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I don't speak duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.61,0:07:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-你到底在干什么? -不要害怕, 公民\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the heck are you? - Fear not, citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.07,0:07:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你最崇拜的英雄, 也是你最需要的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the hero you need and the hero you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色的黎明驱逐了黑暗的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blue dawn that banishes the darkest...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.17,0:07:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心没人会受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Nobody's gonna get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么东西? -炸弹, 炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are those? - Bombs. Bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.58,0:07:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是炸弹! 那些是炸弹!\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bombs! Those are bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松啦! 这玩意儿都没亮灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. They're not even lit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.41,0:07:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我再说一遍, 没人会…(受伤)\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll say again, nobody's gonna get...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.99,0:07:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我错了! 我们要完蛋了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong! We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.59,0:08:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你为啥不减速?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you slowing down?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这确实需要踩刹车(脚太短)\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would require brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.25,0:08:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好烫脚, 热, 热, 热! 烫, 烫, 烫!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hot. Hot, hot, hot! Hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你丫为啥不让警察来处理?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just let the police handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这不是英雄们所做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's not what heroes do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,非常感谢你, 请不要鼓掌.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much. Please hold your applause.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到了吗? 还有一枚炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that? There's one bomb left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.65,0:08:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你检查过座位下面吗? -我当然查过座位下面了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you check under the seat? - Of course I checked under the seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是太菜了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are terrible at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你这消极的态度很影响周围的人.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your negative attitude is not helping anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,它就在你这后面尖尖的东西里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in your spiky things!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怪不得我一直找不到!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never find anything in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,把它从市中心抽走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drained it from downtown!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看见了吧! 我告诉过你没人会受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I told you nobody would get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.16,0:08:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 果汁店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy sherbet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 你好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不要惊慌, 这只是一次演习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't panic. This is only a drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.22,0:09:05.69,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-过来 - 不用谢我公民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here! - No need to thank me, citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.94,0:09:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,在整个晚上的工作中…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in a night's work for...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色正义!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.81,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个可怕的英雄!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrible hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.49,0:10:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-早上好, 韦德! -早上好, 索尼克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Morning, Wade! - Morning, Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好, 青山!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, green hills!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.55,0:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你了, 长爪(索尼克1中养育它的人)\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, longclaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.96,0:11:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让你感到骄傲.\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to make you proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.87,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在闭上眼休息一下.\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now for a little shut-eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,奥兹, 早上好!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ozzy, morning breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.53,0:11:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克  你还在床上吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic. Are you still in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该见见汤姆, 知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to meet Tom, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好哒, 好哒, 我起来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, I'm up! I'm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,多么美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你出来陪我, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming out, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你和我最近在一起的时间不太多.\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like you and me, we haven't had much time together lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你钓得怎么样? 上钩了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going over there? You getting any bites?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会游泳! 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't swim! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.70,0:12:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我死了, 千万别去我房间里窥探我的隐私!\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I die, don't look in my closet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 嘿, 很好, 你没事的, 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, you're good. You're all right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-好冷!  - 好了, 好了, 没事了.\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's freezing. - All right, okay. Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚你钓鱼睡觉, 还掉到了水里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that you've had a nap and a bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.53,0:12:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,对了, 其实我昨晚去你房间给你带了些新的漫画…发现…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went up to your room last night to bring you some new comics and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哇, 哇, 哇, 停在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是我就不会再靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't come any closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我吃了太多带辣椒的热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this little hedgehog had way too many chili dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,噢不, 噢不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.01,0:12:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我很难受, 快受不了了, 快走开!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so embarrassed. Get out of here quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.28,0:12:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 不, 我的屁又要来了了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, here comes another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.61,0:12:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快去吧快去忙你自己事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Now. Save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哇, 哇, 哇, 停在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa. Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是我就不会再靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't come any closer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.49,0:12:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我吃了太多带辣椒的热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because this little hedgehog had way too many chili dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,噢不, 噢不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我很难受, 快受不了了, 快走开!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so embarrassed. Get out of here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道, 我应该用真正的屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I should've used real farts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们要这样多少次? -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}-How many times are we gonna do this? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,难道放掉抢劫犯, 什么也不做? 好像是抢的十亿来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast your line and not catch anything? Seems like a billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你知道我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.49,0:13:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,撒谎骗人, 还偷偷溜出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lying. The sneaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,然后假装自己是"蝙蝠侠"那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pretending to be Batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-"蓝色正义"这不挺酷的商标吗? - 别讲那些你真的太鲁莽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blue justice, trademark pending. - Whatever. You're being reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,别说这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this conversation again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.68,0:13:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿我也不想说这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. It's no fun for me, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果你继续不负责任, 我们会继续谈下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you keep being irresponsible, we're gonna keep having this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我有我自己的权力怎么叫不负责任?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it irresponsible to use my powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 你摧毁了整个街区!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, you destroyed an entire city block!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.57,0:13:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那个街区已经乱七八糟了 谁在乎呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That block was already messed up. Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.49,0:13:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我阻止了一次抢劫 我是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I stopped a robbery. I was a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你把人们置于危险之中 而这不是英雄所做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you put people in danger and that's not what a hero does.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.57,0:13:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是我老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop trying to be my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.15,0:13:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 仅仅照顾好自己不是成为英雄的全部元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, taking care of yourself is not what being a hero's all about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.89,0:13:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,而是要敢于为他人承担责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about taking responsibility for other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:14:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,现在, 我不管你想不想听, 但你还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now, whether you want to hear this or not, you are still just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,在你准备好成为大英雄之前, 你还有很多事情要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got some more growing up to do before you're ready to be the big hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,但我相信你一定可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}But trust me when I tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,总有一天你的力量会被认可的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will come a time when your powers will be needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.88,0:14:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能去主宰那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't choose that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,而是那一刻终究会降临在你身上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That moment chooses you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.40,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看这儿, 我都起鸡皮疙瘩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. I just got goose bumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.24,0:14:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,等等, 你说的这些是搬奥普拉的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Did you steal that from Oprah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 伙计, 这是瓦乔夫斯基家族的名言\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. That is a wachowski family special.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是来自我爸爸, 也在这条船上, 也在这个湖面上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came from my dad, in this very boat, on this very lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他总是引导我走正确的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would always try and steer me in the right direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是玛蒂和我一直想告诉你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what maddie and I have always tried to do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.07,0:14:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,所以, 在你重任将至那一刻之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, until your moment arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你能更负责任一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to work on being a little more responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.19,0:14:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comprende?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comprende.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,击掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}High five on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮! 啊哈甜甜圈主人和蓝蓝侠又回来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Donut lord and the blue blur are back at it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快艇来咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speedboat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.78,0:15:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.11,0:15:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去夏威夷, 你有多开心?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How excited are you, going to Hawaii with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哦耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到索尼克航空, 最快的旅行方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Sonic air, the fastest way to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在第一组和第二组进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now boarding groups one and two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.82,0:15:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克 这太有趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, this is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.34,0:15:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思, 这位女士, 您是第三组, 请等一下才会轮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, ma'am, you're group three. Please wait your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 第一组和第二组有人吗? 没人? -让它别沉浸其中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anyone from groups one and two? Nobody? - Just let him get it out of his system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 那么其他人都往这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then everybody else right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.24,0:15:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,到你了, 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,检测到一件糟糕的衬衫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrible shirt detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.61,0:15:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 你可以走了, 祝你旅途愉快, 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you're free to go. Enjoy your trip. Bye-bye now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,要来抱抱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆, 我第一次一个人当家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, I'm about to be hedgehog of the house for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我需要成熟一点了, 用抱抱告别不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm a little mature to hug you goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 那要不碰个拳?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what about a power bump?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-碰拳? -对, 碰拳!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Power bump? - Yes, power bump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.97,0:16:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-瓦乔夫斯基! -瓦乔夫斯基!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wachowski! - Wachowski!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 用这个回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, use this one to get back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我们走了 乖点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're off. Be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对了, 你有我们的电话号码哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You have our number.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉听不见!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry! Can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你正在穿越一个跨维度的地方!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're traveling through a cross-dimensional portal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 已经开始想你了! -好吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss you already! - Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.47,0:16:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在瑞秋的婚礼上玩得开心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun at Rachel's wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.91,0:16:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他们回来还有48小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's 48 hours until they come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有电视TV, 上网, 一屋子吃的, 没有人监视\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got TV channels, streaming channels, a house full of food and no supervision.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.49,0:16:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们尽情嗨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.67,0:18:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这些读数准确, 他应该就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If these readings are accurate, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到他了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我不会太晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just hope I'm not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我只需要找到一个不被发现的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need a way to reach him without being spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.91,0:18:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,标准的人力交通工具, 完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard human transport. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.54,0:18:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aloha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么样, 伙计  - 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going, bud? - Oh, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,依然安静的夜晚, 在家看着书呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a quiet night at home, settling in with a good book.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你呢? 你怎么了? -我打电话只是想说我们到了这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you? What's up with you? - I was just calling to say we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.03,0:19:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在你说的每一句话都让我怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now every word out of your mouth is making me suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你得放松点, 伙计 你应该在瓦胡岛四季酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to relax, buddy. You're at the four seasons oahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,来一杯鸡尾酒, 享受和你妻子在一起的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a Mai Tai. Enjoy some time with your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在某个地方做些羞羞的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get sunburned somewhere embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这个周末是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This weekend is about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 你说得对 我记得我们碰过拳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're right. We power-bumped on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所以不管你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever it is you're doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.92,0:19:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你能在我们回家的时复原一切, 对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you can undo it by the time we get home, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.46,0:19:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当然, 我的意思是, 被这样怀疑让我感到有种被冒犯的感觉不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly! I mean, I am deeply offended by such accusations!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋的未婚对象如何呀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how's Rachel's fiance?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.03,0:19:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他本人和照片上一样好看吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he as good-looking in person as he is in pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好像看起来还行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow better-looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.43,0:19:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,哇! 看来你就要成为家里第三位帅哥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! You're about to be the third best-looking dude in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.98,0:19:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而且, 嘿, 还是在婚礼殿台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, still on the podium.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我去自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I better go and introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.39,0:19:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,别惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦? 闹哪样, 这里的一切就都很正常啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trouble? Don't worry. Everything here is completely normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯哼, 晚安, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. Night, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.52,0:19:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 我过来打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I was just coming over to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.30,0:19:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我未婚妻所做的事, 你还有勇气来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a lot of nerve coming up in here after what you did to my fiancee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等, 什么? -比如她的车?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. What? - Totaling her car?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.74,0:20:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,再比如把她绑在椅子上? 我想我应该把你大卸八块\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving her tied to a chair? I should rip you limb from limb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪, 看看你的脸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, look at your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.97,0:20:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆, 冷静, 宝贝, 我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tommy, breathe, baby. Breathe. I was kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿, 伙计, 我真的在开玩笑  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, man, I was totally kidding. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-你在开玩笑 -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You were kidding. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.90,0:20:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啦, 瑞秋让我这么做的, 这完全是她的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Rachel put me up to it. It was totally her idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真流氓\N{\fnArial\fs30}That rascal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听着, 我不知道你是否知道. 瑞秋根本不在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I don't know if you're aware. Rachel does not care for you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.69,0:20:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的, 兄弟, 你还有工作要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, bro, you got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿!  -嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你! 谢谢你来, 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you! Thanks for coming, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-真高兴你来了 -真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really glad you came. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你 祝贺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great to see you, too. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是, 你们在一起会很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you guys, you guys seem really happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的, 你说得对, 托马斯·沃乔夫斯基\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're all right, Thomas wachowski.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们能和好吗? -我很乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we Bury the hatchet? - I'd love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗? -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-好了, 抱一下了啦 -太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, bring it in! - All right! Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:20:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你搞砸了我的婚礼, 我会毙了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you screw up my wedding, I will end you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好了奥兹, 这是索尼克之家的电影之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, ozzy, it's movie night at casa de Sonic,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,轮到你选频道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's your turn to pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但我不会再看雪狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am not watching snow dogs again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那部电影太差劲了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That movie is the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.45,0:21:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,停电了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackout!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,奥兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ozzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉, 伙计 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, buddy. Everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可不玩恶作剧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. We did not order a poltergeist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果门外是送披萨那个家伙, 那这真的不太专业呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is the pizza guy, this is really unprofessional.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.59,0:22:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,蛋人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eggman?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.11,0:22:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见, 小刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.32,0:22:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你想我没?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你是怎么回来的, 但你来这里是大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how you got back, but you made a big mistake coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.55,0:22:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au contraire, mon frere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.77,0:22:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,上次PK你以为你完胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mistake was thinking you'd won.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.36,0:22:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但那只是一个插曲, 一个开胃小菜而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was just a prelude, an hors d'oeuvre,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.86,0:22:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,一杯开胃酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}An aperitif, an amuse-bouche.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.11,0:22:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你不会懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不过马上你就懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're about to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.70,0:22:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,顺带加上那个白痴警长和他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so will that idiot sheriff and his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,最后还有你的小狗一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your little dog too!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pitiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.97,0:23:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 你是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.75,0:23:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是很没礼貌?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.32,0:23:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 介绍下这是纳克尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, meet knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.70,0:23:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My new bffae.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.99,0:23:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,永远的好朋友!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bestest friend forever and ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,听着机器蛋人, 我不管你带谁来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, robotnik, I don't care who you brought to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.66,0:23:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远得不到我的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never going to get my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那我看起来像是需要你的力量吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like I need your power?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.78,0:23:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果恶魔真的存在的话, 那真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nice when diabolical evil lives up to the hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.07,0:23:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.90,0:23:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要吗? 那来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it? Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.87,0:23:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为你会更厉害呢, 你根本没招\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was expecting more of you. You're unskilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:23:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没有受过训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.77,0:24:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你不配!\N{\fnArial\fs30}And unworthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.11,0:24:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你忘了我还有一招叫"势不可挡".\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot one. Unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.28,0:24:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我注定要做我祖先做不到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my destiny to do what my ancestors could not...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.09,0:24:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复我族人家园的终极力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}To restore the ultimate power to the home of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.22,0:24:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,终极力量? 我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultimate power? I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.86,0:24:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你找错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.45,0:24:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,终极力量?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultimate power?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.82,0:24:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你说的是我口头禅.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're speaking my language.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我装傻, 长爪的徒弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't play dumb with me, apprentice of longclaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.95,0:24:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识长爪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew longclaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.41,0:25:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,长爪和她的族人是我们部落的宿敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longclaw and her people were the sworn enemy of my tribe, the echidna.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.82,0:25:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在他们手中战斗和牺牲, 现在你将在我的手中死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought and died at their hands, and now you will die at mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.48,0:25:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,快点, 上车, 我是站在你这边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get in! I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.54,0:25:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉, 你是哪位?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.63,0:25:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.31,0:25:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,带我离开这里! 快, 快, 快, 快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us out of here! Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.52,0:25:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个癫了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone rabid!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.52,0:25:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真恶心, 他在舔吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross! Is he licking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.07,0:25:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再见!\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.53,0:25:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,劝你打针吃点药, 蛋人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure to get your shots, eggman!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦, 很荣幸终于见到你了, 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Okay. Let me just say it is an honor to finally meet you, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.45,0:26:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以叫你索尼克吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it okay if I call you Sonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.99,0:26:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都叫我尾巴, 你想知道为什么吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone calls me tails. You're probably wondering why.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.95,0:26:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜, 是因为多了个尾巴吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Because of the extra tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.33,0:26:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没错, 我就知道你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right! I should've known you'd get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.54,0:26:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,酷, 对了, 这是怎么回事? 机器蛋人怎么回来?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Also, what is going on? Robotnik's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.30,0:26:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,谁是克利福德, 那个愤怒的红色大怪物?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who is Clifford the big red rage monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.27,0:26:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那是纳克尔斯,最后一批针鼹\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's knuckles, the last of the echidnas...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.35,0:26:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,也是银河系最危险的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the most dangerous warrior in the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.07,0:26:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他一心想找到翡翠大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's obsessed with finding the master emerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.23,0:26:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗? 翡翠大师?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious? The master emerald?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.49,0:26:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,那只是个睡前故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just a bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.28,0:26:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但他相信这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he believes it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.85,0:26:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他一直认为你是找到翡翠大师的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he must think you're the key to finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.28,0:26:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,红灯! 把方向盘给我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red light! Give me the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.03,0:26:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿你干嘛…-把脚挪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what are you... - Move your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.77,0:26:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们甩掉他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.89,0:26:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看来没有甩掉他, 我们真的没有甩掉他!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did not lose him. We definitely did not lose him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.01,0:27:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个主意, 你信我吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an idea. Do you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.03,0:27:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不信, 我才刚认识你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not! I literally just met you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还是让我来吧 -你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just let me. Come on! - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.42,0:27:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.37,0:27:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你的屁股变成直升机了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your butt just turn into a helicopter?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.73,0:27:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,屁股直升机!\N{\fnArial\fs30}A butt-copter!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.09,0:27:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你索尼克才能想出这叫法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Sonic the hedgehog could come up with something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.61,0:27:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,狡猾的招数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foxy move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想把事情做好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want something done right...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须雇一个你可以随意摆布的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to hire someone you can push around.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.40,0:28:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,全部大写\N{\fnArial\fs30}All caps.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.61,0:28:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,博士, 你在那里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.97,0:28:41.97,Note,,0,0,0,,(博士的消息: 准备好我的拿铁咖啡)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.02,0:28:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我, 我很抱歉, 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, I'm sorry, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.11,0:28:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我得早点关门, 大家都出去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to close early. Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.03,0:28:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都出去, 谢谢你们来我店里喝咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody out. Thank you for visiting the mean bean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.07,0:28:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 晚安, 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, good night. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.37,0:29:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.03,0:29:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.77,0:30:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这才像话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.03,0:30:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我又重生了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been re-hatched!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.68,0:30:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,所以, 那位拥有巨大超能力的朋友,\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my massively metacarpaled friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.93,0:30:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你提到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mentioned...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.90,0:30:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,终极力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultimate power.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.40,0:30:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是在类似房子那种建筑里吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.82,0:30:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说翡翠大师?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The master emerald?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.26,0:30:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.58,0:30:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你从那个星球救出来, 然后你把我带到刺猬这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you off that planet and you brought me to the hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.72,0:30:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经没有合作价值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no more use for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.86,0:30:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧我不想跟你唱反调, 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I hate to be a contrarian, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.11,0:30:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们还可以继续合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we might.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.86,0:30:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这些机器能和我对抗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think these machines are a match for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.15,0:31:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我能把它们撕得粉碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shatter them like the bones from a fallen...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.61,0:31:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,原来是梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.44,0:31:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你看, 地球是我的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, earth is my turf, g.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.11,0:31:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你不知道开源高科技程序, 没有我你会迷路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't know how to floss, you'll be lost without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.86,0:31:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚说的什么我简直听不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand nothing of what you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.82,0:31:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我能帮你找到翡翠大师, 然后你用它来. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}I help you retrieve the emerald, and you use it to...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.23,0:31:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,消灭王八蛋刺猬!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy the hedgehog!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.91,0:31:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是你我结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're suggesting an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.03,0:31:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在地球, 我们一般用握手的方式表示达成协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around here we simply grip each other's hands tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.28,0:31:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个野蛮的太空乡巴佬!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You truculent space bumpkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.12,0:31:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我可爱的小手弄伤了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've crushed my favorite hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.82,0:31:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗? 我的手一点感觉都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? My hand is uninjured.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.15,0:31:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但我赞同你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm now convinced of your commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.66,0:31:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"哦, 太好了"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, goody,"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.28,0:31:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他同意了, 到最后再同时重置纳克尔斯他们两个刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}He exclaimed, while he reset two of his knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.79,0:32:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.27,0:32:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴能加入这个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delighted to be on the same team.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.19,0:32:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,公路旅行!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.03,0:32:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐靠窗位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you stick your nose out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.12,0:32:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 我们在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.19,0:32:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到韦德基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Wade cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.57,0:32:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望有一天能对一个女人说这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is something I hope to someday say to a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.70,0:32:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一个不是我妈妈的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman who's not my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.77,0:32:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,韦德 认真点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade, focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.49,0:32:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得搞清楚为什么纳克尔斯认为我是找到翡翠大师的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to figure out why knuckles thinks I'm the key to finding the master emerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.28,0:32:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么提到长爪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why did he mention longclaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.06,0:32:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这其中一定有关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be a connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.62,0:32:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等等, 有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.57,0:32:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看, 长爪鸟给我的地图上有个翡翠宝石符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. There's an emerald symbol on the map longclaw gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.57,0:32:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前从来不知道这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never knew what it meant before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.15,0:32:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么东西亮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.00,0:33:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,长爪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longclaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.38,0:33:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你好, 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.08,0:33:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你正在看这个, 说明我出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're watching this, then something has happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.53,0:33:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我祈祷你能平安到达地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I pray you've made it to earth unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.69,0:33:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,地球之所以被选中, 有一个非常重要的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world has been chosen for a very important reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.24,0:33:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那是翡翠宝石的秘密藏身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the secret location of the master emerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.99,0:33:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,翡翠宝石拥有将思想变为现实的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emerald has the power to turn thoughts into reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.46,0:33:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就像《捉鬼敢死队》里的绵花糖鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the stay puft marshmallow man from ghostbusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.43,0:33:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果落入坏人之手, 可能会威胁到宇宙中的所有生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the wrong hands it could threaten all life in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.57,0:33:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,保护翡翠是我神圣的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protecting the emerald was my sacred duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.57,0:33:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我必须把这个责任交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I must pass that responsibility to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.36,0:33:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这将是属于我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.25,0:33:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着地图, 找到翡翠, 保护它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the map, find the emerald, and keep it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.20,0:33:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Sonic,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.83,0:33:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你有一颗我从未见过的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a heart like no creature I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.41,0:33:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我好爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.73,0:33:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.64,0:34:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不, 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.24,0:34:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你失望的, 长爪鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you down, longclaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.15,0:34:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那是你爸爸吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is that you, your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.32,0:34:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.86,0:34:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.61,0:34:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,根据这张地图, 第一条线索在西伯利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to this map, the first clue is in Siberia.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.76,0:34:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个能指引我们找到翡翠的指南针\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a compass that will lead to the emerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.99,0:34:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,而且纳克尔斯已经在这里了, 这是一场比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with knuckles already here, it's a race.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.90,0:34:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,纳克尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knuckles?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.65,0:34:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我在中学认识一个叫纳克尔斯的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew a kid in middle school named knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以把整个拳头塞进嘴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could fit his whole fist in his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.62,0:34:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是同一个纳克尔斯, 我们就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is the same knuckles, we are screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.46,0:34:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这个纳克尔斯, 那个纳克尔斯, 都不影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}This knuckles, that knuckles. It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.08,0:34:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要先到那个地方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get there first.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.82,0:34:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"我们"是什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean,"we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.82,0:34:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.38,0:34:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.45,0:34:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我想告诉你, 我不擅长野外行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just came here to warn you. I'm not a field guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.82,0:34:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心, 我会保护你的, 我不会让你出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I got your back. I won't let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.03,0:35:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是"碰拳", 在地球上, 这意味着一个无法打破的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a power bump. On earth, it means an unbreakable promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.25,0:35:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.24,0:35:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,博士, 真的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor. It's really you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.57,0:35:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.74,0:35:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸又有了新长的胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papa's got a brand new 'stache.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.61,0:35:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道, 我就知道! 我就知道你会回来的, 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. I knew it! I knew you'd come back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.24,0:35:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在做你爱喝的拿铁山羊奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never stopped steaming your Austrian goat's milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.61,0:35:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来点蘑菇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could use some mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.82,0:35:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你带来了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought something.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.75,0:35:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,像是某种太空豪猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of space porcupine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.03,0:35:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,太空豪猪, 我是针鼹鼠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Porcupine? I am an echidna!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.11,0:35:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,从出生就接受各种形式的致命战斗训练,\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trained since birth in all forms of lethal combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.86,0:36:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,注定要恢复我部落的荣誉,\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destined to restore honor to my tribe,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.18,0:36:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,并且愿意摧毁任何挡我道的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And willing to destroy anything that gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.49,0:36:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.07,0:36:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这说明他信任你,"石头"\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means he trusts you, stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.61,0:36:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,现在让我们重新变换下这个地方!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's renovate this dump!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.99,0:36:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,(语音启动命令):"拿铁奥地利山羊奶"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Latte with steamed Austrian goat milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.65,0:36:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好球相当不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one. Solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.11,0:36:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-抱歉伙计们 -这就是比赛!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, fellas. - That's game!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.57,0:36:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们干得漂亮! 干得漂亮!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how we do! That's how we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.58,0:36:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-毕竟是他们擅长的嘛? -团队合作使得梦想成真!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But are they good at math? - Teamwork makes the dream work!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.78,0:36:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉, 大个子汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about that, big Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.75,0:37:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-你没事吧? -没事没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you good? - All good. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.65,0:37:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 谢谢你邀请我和你的伴郎们一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Thanks for inviting me out to hang with you and your groomsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.03,0:37:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,高质量的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good quality bonding.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.98,0:37:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗, 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, bro,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.40,0:37:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那边的那些人, 他们可比我的伴郎厉害多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys right there, they're way more than my groomsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的战友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.35,0:37:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没有他们, 我这辈子都活不下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never would've made it through life without 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.15,0:37:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,过来啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.44,0:37:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了, 我来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm coming! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.82,0:37:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-回头见 -好的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll catch you later. - Hey. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.80,0:37:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你准备好做力量瑜伽了就告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me know if you're ready for some power yoga.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.12,0:37:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-当然 -来吧小汤姆加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You bet. - Come on, Tommy boy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.27,0:37:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.93,0:37:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.15,0:37:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.24,0:37:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿汤姆叔叔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uncle Tommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.70,0:37:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 姑娘们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.41,0:37:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.76,0:37:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-那些是结婚戒指吗? -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are those the wedding rings? - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.62,0:37:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看看吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.55,0:37:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她对待小魔戒的工作非常认真哦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little ring bearer has been taking her job very seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.34,0:37:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-她整个早上都在练习 -我看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's been practicing all morning. - I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.74,0:37:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你真有责任心\N{\fnArial\fs30}How very responsible of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.03,0:37:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不过不是应该有两个结婚戒指吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except aren't there supposed to be two wedding rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.53,0:37:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,啊哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.90,0:37:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-汤姆叔叔? -等等这是怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uncle Tommy? - Hang on. What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.74,0:37:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你会做得很好的, 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna do great, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.18,0:37:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.08,0:37:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-嘿宝贝 -嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, baby. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.51,0:38:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没错! 新郎在楼里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right! Groom in the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.05,0:38:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.79,0:38:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望索尼克也能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish Sonic had that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.74,0:38:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,-肌肉男? -控制一下自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Muscles? - Control yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.03,0:38:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 伙伴, 僚人, 一个小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Buddies. Wingmen. A squad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.89,0:38:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克没有这种东西, 他是单飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic doesn't have anything like that. He's flying solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.20,0:38:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝, 你别这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, you got to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.50,0:38:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你在四季酒店\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at the four seasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.27,0:38:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喝杯鸡尾酒, 陪陪你老婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a Mai Tai. Spend some time with your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.86,0:38:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是这么说的, 说真的, 他的原话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what he said. Seriously, his exact words.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.88,0:38:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗? 他是个聪明的孩子  他会找到路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? He's a smart kid. He'll find his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.29,0:38:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我完全找不到路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I absolutely cannot find my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.30,0:38:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们彻底彻底地, 彻底地, 彻底地迷路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are completely, totally, unequivocally lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.22,0:38:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 在这种天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, in this weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.78,0:38:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这东西不可能有读数的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we're gonna get any readings on this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.86,0:38:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们要回去吗? -不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Should we go back? - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.75,0:38:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,前面有灯光, 也许我们可以在那里避避\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a light up ahead. Maybe we can take shelter in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.53,0:38:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.76,0:39:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定吗? 我们不知道里面是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this? We don't know who's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.95,0:39:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心, 在地球上, 人们非常热情好客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. On earth, people are very welcoming,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.21,0:39:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢带陌生人回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And love taking complete strangers into their homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.93,0:39:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.40,0:39:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我两个人的桌子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Table for two, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.19,0:39:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你要点什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.68,0:39:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,请来两份炖牛肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two beef stews, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.50,0:39:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-你从哪儿弄来这么酷的小玩意? -我发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get all these cool gadgets? - I invented 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.86,0:40:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kinda my thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.86,0:40:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上, 是我的发明让我发现了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, my inventions are how I discovered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.15,0:40:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得那晚在棒球场吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that night at the baseball field?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.83,0:40:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你的能量冲击波一路到达了我的母星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your energy blast reached all the way to my home planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.36,0:40:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到你从那个胡子男手里救了全村的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you save your whole village from that crazy mustache guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.08,0:40:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,等等, 所以你一直在监视我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, so you've been watching me this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.40,0:40:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,即使是在洗澡的时候?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in the shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.36,0:40:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个棘手的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a trick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.97,0:40:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刺猬索尼克更喜欢泡泡浴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic the hedgehog prefers bubble baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.38,0:40:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计, 你真厉害!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, you're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.80,0:40:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,当我知道纳克尔斯在追踪你的时候,\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I learned knuckles was on your trail,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.36,0:40:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我不能再袖手旁观了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew I couldn't just sit back and watch anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.24,0:40:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须来告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to come warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.13,0:40:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Hang on one sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.91,0:40:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,甜甜圈主人来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donut lord is checking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.37,0:40:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"放松一下, 看看电视"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Just chilling. Watching TV. "
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.40,0:40:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,点, 点, 点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dot, dot, dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.86,0:40:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,点, 点, 点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dot, dot, dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.75,0:40:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,点, 点, 点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dot, dot, dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.81,0:40:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,点, 点, 点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dot, dot, dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.90,0:40:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,点, 点, 点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dot, dot, dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.99,0:40:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.99,0:41:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么要和这个白痴合作?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we working with this imbecile?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.65,0:41:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那个头脑简单的太空豪猪是开启奇迹的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that simpleminded space trash is the key to something extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.15,0:41:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你向刺猬复仇的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to help you get revenge on the hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.20,0:41:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,想大一点, 斯通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think bigger, stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.99,0:41:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他寻找的翡翠宝石对我疯狂的设计有很大帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emerald he seeks could power my wildest designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.40,0:41:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我卓越的才能不会仅限于地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}My genius wouldn't just be recognized on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.98,0:41:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,它会像病毒一样传播到银河系的每个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would spread virally to every corner of the galaxy,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.98,0:41:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让我能够驾驭宇宙中所有的负面力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allowing me to harness all the negative forces of the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.00,0:41:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,与黑暗本身交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}And commune with darkness itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,哇, 听起来很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That sounds big.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.36,0:41:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这是写在我愿望板上多年来的梦想  这就是吸引力法则\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been on my vision board for years. It's the law of attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.61,0:41:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看到秘密吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you see the secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.28,0:41:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,卡普洛伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaplooey!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.40,0:41:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,卡普洛伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaplooey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.53,0:41:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,又一个在家无聊的夜晚  "\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Another boring night at home. "
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.91,0:41:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,刺猬回家了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hedgehog has returned home!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.90,0:41:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Falsa  在拉丁语里是"错了"的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falsa. Which is Latin for "wrong-o. "
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.07,0:41:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,根据我的全球网络基站三角测量结果他在撒谎,\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to my worldwide network cell tower triangulation, he's lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.99,0:41:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.20,0:42:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,来自西伯利亚东部雄伟的腹地\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the majestic hinterlands of eastern Siberia.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.20,0:42:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个异地恋骗子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a long-distance liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.78,0:42:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊, 还有更多呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there's more where that came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.36,0:42:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法小刺猬被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiny magic hedgehog destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.82,0:42:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,现在让我们开始探索吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's begin our quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.74,0:42:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.04,0:42:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你的仆人呢? 山羊挤奶工\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your Minion? The goat milker.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.15,0:42:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,船上没有斯通的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no room on the ship for stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.49,0:42:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要我说, 甩掉他, 甩掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we ditch him, ghost him, blow him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.46,0:42:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,耻辱!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dishonor!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.77,0:42:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,"这"就是我的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dis" is how I roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.79,0:42:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 我点的是炖牛肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but I asked for the beef stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.06,0:42:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你的口气闻起来像山羊粪便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your breath smells like goat poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.09,0:42:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.97,0:42:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,大家过来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.87,0:43:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.90,0:43:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们以为今天是我的生日?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they think it's my birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.36,0:43:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心, 我会处理的  好了, 各位, 放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll take care of this. Okay, everybody, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.90,0:43:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信一定有很好的解决方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure there's a perfectly good explanation...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.95,0:43:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不管我朋友说了什么, 做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For whatever my friend said or did.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.10,0:43:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.40,0:43:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚放屁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just farted.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.27,0:43:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,喵喵?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meow?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.44,0:43:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把这些怪物扔进火里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw these monsters in the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.45,0:43:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 不, 不, 别这样, 伙计们, 放松点, 我们好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no. Come on, guys. Take it easy. Let's talk this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.11,0:43:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们好好谈谈!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk this through!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.79,0:43:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别别别, 扫描西伯利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Scanning siberian customs.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.69,0:43:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这机器一定有什么故障 -尾巴, 你在干什么, 快点啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's got to be something in here. - Tails, whatever you're doing, do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.26,0:43:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我找到了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pivonka Pivonka\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pivonka! Pivonka!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.76,0:43:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pivonka\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pivonka!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.36,0:44:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Da.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.90,0:44:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pivonka\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pivonka!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.74,0:44:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 什么是"pivonka"?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails, what's a "pivonka"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.08,0:44:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是西伯利亚人解决问题的惯用方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a siberian custom to resolve disputes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.99,0:44:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们赢了, 他们就放我们走  如果我们输了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we win, they let us go. If we lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.28,0:44:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 我们得拿上地图离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we have to grab the map and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.63,0:44:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,地图在哪里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.49,0:44:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 不  我把它落在桌子上了! 看!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. I left it on the table! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.03,0:44:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.35,0:45:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊, 这是舞蹈比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, it's a dance fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.83,0:45:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 我们该怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.70,0:45:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能跳舞, 然后拿到地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}We dance and get that map.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.12,0:45:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.63,0:45:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 现在开始  不, 我们要去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now let's do. No, we're gonna go...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.96,0:45:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.59,0:45:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,地图! 快来, 我们抓住它!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The map! Come on, let's grab it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.41,0:46:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要这个?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.20,0:46:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,过来拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come get.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.39,0:46:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.11,0:46:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.56,0:46:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎! 怪胎! 怪胎!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.86,0:46:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎! 怪胎! 怪胎!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.03,0:46:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎! 怪胎! 怪胎!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.32,0:46:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怪胎! 怪胎! 怪胎!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaks! Freaks! Freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.96,0:46:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了, 尾巴? 振作点, 我需要你!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, tails? Come on. I need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.61,0:46:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到, 索尼克  我不像你那么勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this, Sonic. I'm not brave like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.61,0:46:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小玩意把我们搞得一团糟, 我还弄丢了你的地图,\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gadget got us in this mess, and I lost your map,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.29,0:46:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会被扔进火堆里的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're gonna get tossed into a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.46,0:46:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,新的DJ来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}New DJ coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.28,0:46:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧, 伙计, 看我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pal. I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.56,0:46:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们叫我们怪胎,\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called us freaks,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.00,0:46:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以让我们变得怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.21,0:46:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我的脚步放心好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow my moves. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.66,0:47:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮! 还有伴舞!\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Backup dancers!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.91,0:47:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,走起来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.38,0:47:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这上面有很多我的影子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of me up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.24,0:47:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱pivonka!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love pivonka!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.46,0:48:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大下马! (体操动作)\N{\fnArial\fs30}And big dismount!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.08,0:48:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,耶!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.74,0:48:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.57,0:48:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们成功了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.83,0:48:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太神奇了, 干得好, 尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was amazing! Way to go, tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.81,0:48:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有刺猬索尼克才能赢得史诗般的舞蹈比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Only Sonic the hedgehog could win a dance battle that epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.51,0:48:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,所以跟着我, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, stick with me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.75,0:48:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,地球可能是一个陌生可怕的地方, 但我知道这个蓝色古老星球的每一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth can be a scary place, but I know everything about this old pale blue dot.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.70,0:48:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是不是所有事情  但我看了很多电视频道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not everything. But I watch a lot of discovery channel and...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.29,0:48:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说我是你的朋友吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant about me being your pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.86,0:48:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当然, 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.57,0:48:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这么热情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comin' in hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.49,0:48:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,从小到大, 我一个朋友都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Growing up, I didn't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.29,0:48:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们村的人都觉得我的两条尾巴很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in my village thought my two tails were weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.28,0:49:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 我知道那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.03,0:49:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我看到了你, 银河系最快的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I saw you, the fastest creature in the galaxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.24,0:49:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你也很奇怪  但你是一个传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were weird too. But you were a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.61,0:49:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我想, 也许古怪也没那么糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That made me think, maybe being weird isn't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.31,0:49:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你激励我离开我的村庄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You inspired me to leave my village,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.49,0:49:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,找到你, 帮助你完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find you and help you in your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.03,0:49:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很高兴你来了, 尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really glad you're here, tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.30,0:49:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我也很开心我能在这里和索尼克一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad I'm here too, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.78,0:49:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 还是睡一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, might as well get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.92,0:49:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉这是个过夜的好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feels like a good place to spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.14,0:49:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你的小发明上会有清晰的读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be able to get clear readings on your gizmo thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.49,0:49:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安, 尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, tails.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.74,0:50:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 尾巴, 出状况了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails. Tails. We have a situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.64,0:50:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,天气预报, 今天的天气晴朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today's forecast calls for clear, sunny skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.54,0:50:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我定位了精确坐标, 就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pinpointed the coordinates. It's right up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.79,0:50:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 尾巴, 等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, tails. Wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.48,0:50:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我们发现了一个巨大的猫头鹰门, 看起来很宏大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we got a giant owl door. Seems encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.11,0:51:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.35,0:51:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-你能翻译一下吗? -没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you translate that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.65,0:51:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很久以前, 一群可怕的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ages ago, a fearsome group of warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.76,0:51:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,被称为针鼹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known as the echidnas,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.33,0:51:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,铸造了七颗宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forged the seven chaos emeralds.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.71,0:51:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,翡翠大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The master emerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.53,0:51:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有了它, 一个战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}With it, a single warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.03,0:51:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人相信会拥有这样的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believing no one should have such power,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.47,0:51:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一群英雄找到了绿宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}An order of heroes recovered the emerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.30,0:51:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来像是猫头鹰和针鼹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like the owls and the echidnas.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.41,0:51:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就像范·迪塞尔和摇滚乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like vin diesel and the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.16,0:51:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.99,0:52:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,巨大的猫头鹰门, 和巨大的猫头鹰  令人深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, giant owl door, giant owl. Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.52,0:52:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下  我以前见过这些符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. I've seen these symbols before.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.52,0:52:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,要来了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.36,0:52:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯, 这起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that did something.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.46,0:52:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,-指南针! -这会带我们找到翡翠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The compass! - This will lead us to the emerald!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.20,0:53:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 你身上有点东西. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got a little something on your...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.74,0:53:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 不, 尾巴, 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Tails, get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.23,0:53:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.58,0:53:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,又是那家伙?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy again?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.64,0:53:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,小心了, 我的小石笋, 是有人叫了优步吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heads up, my little stalagmites. Someone call an uber?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.24,0:53:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 谢谢你帮我做了这么多难事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks for doing all the hard stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.95,0:53:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来由我们接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.53,0:53:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我们得谈谈你的新造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we really gotta talk about your new look.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.66,0:53:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就像 x 教授遇到了大富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like professor x meets the monopoly man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.57,0:53:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的天才会开敞篷车去西伯利亚?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what kind of genius shows up to Siberia in a convertible?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.32,0:53:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,像我们这种天才都是热情高涨的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind of genius that can turn up the heat...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.08,0:53:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,只需轻轻按一下开关\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a flick of a switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.58,0:54:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,好一个! 我想那应该没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good one! I'm sure that wasn't important.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.45,0:54:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 那是出口, 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails, that's our exit. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.77,0:54:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.82,0:54:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-你上我下 -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You go high, I go low. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.41,0:54:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,快速伸展一下, 来咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick little stretch and here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.74,0:54:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,想跟我玩吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.36,0:54:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这招不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.89,0:54:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.44,0:55:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,打雪仗!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snowball fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.30,0:55:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太简单了, 来吧, 挑战我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too easy. Come on, challenge me!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.28,0:55:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在乎的是造型加潇洒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are talking style and pizzazz.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.61,0:55:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮! 我这波操作太牛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! I make this look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.70,0:55:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 真好, 冬兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. The winter soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.82,0:56:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,对于一个叫纳克尔斯的人来说, 你真的不擅长打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a guy named knuckles, you are really bad at punching.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.24,0:56:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,交出罗盘! 你不是我的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender the compass! You are no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.03,0:56:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我这辈子都在为此训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been training for this my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.57,0:56:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有受过任何训练, 但是现在我在你前面呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had no training at all, yet here I am ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.28,0:56:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta be embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.89,0:56:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我的戒指!\N{\fnArial\fs30}My rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.07,0:56:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,有人告诉过你, 你有严重的情绪问题吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone ever told you you've got serious anger issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.72,0:56:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你用无聊的笑话嘲笑我,\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mock me with your weak jokes,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.18,0:56:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我一无所知, 刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know nothing about me, hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.45,0:56:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们这些针鼹总是不请自来, 还毁了我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know you echidnas have a habit of showing up uninvited and ruining my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.84,0:56:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,毁了你的生活? 开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruining your life? Another bad joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.04,0:56:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你我是真的失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost everything because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.22,0:56:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的部落即将取得最大的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tribe was on the verge of its greatest victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.49,0:56:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一个猫头鹰战士被找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last of the owl warriors had been located.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.36,0:56:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,长爪的翡翠秘密即将属于我们部落的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon longclaw's emerald secrets would be ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.21,0:56:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但我父亲阻止我加入战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my father stopped me from joining the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.80,0:57:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他说我继承家族荣誉的那一刻迟早会到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said my moment to honor our tribe would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.11,0:57:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was not this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.59,0:57:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他对我说的最后一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were the last words he spoke to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.45,0:57:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,之后我再也没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never saw him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.03,0:57:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那天我们都失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both lost everything that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.68,0:57:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再见, 索尼克 -不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goodbye, Sonic. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.62,0:57:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,长爪!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Longclaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.70,0:57:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.57,0:57:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,骗子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deceiver!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.79,0:57:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 我没有骗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.37,0:57:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 拿着罗盘先离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails, take the compass and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.16,0:57:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.49,0:57:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,回见, 讨厌鬼们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, haters!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.74,0:57:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.94,0:57:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 快醒醒啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails, come on. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.66,0:57:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他选择帮助狐狸而不是追求指南针\N{\fnArial\fs30}He chose helping the fox over pursuing the compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.49,0:58:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,当然了, 新朋友, 同样可悲的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course he did. New friend, same pathetic weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.95,0:58:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 不, 不, 不, 不, 我们真的有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No, no, no. We're in real trouble here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.29,0:58:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快点, 尾巴, 我需要你带我们飞离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, tails. I need you to fly us out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.08,0:58:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该起床了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.72,0:58:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,再见, 孩子们, 好好享受新鲜的奶粉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See ya, kids. Enjoy the fresh powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.03,0:58:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.76,0:59:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这些戒指代表. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}These rings signify the...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.51,0:59:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.05,0:59:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为它是静音的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought it was on silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.99,0:59:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这些戒指. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}These rings...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.49,0:59:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你了, 汤姆思!\N{\fnArial\fs30}So help me, Thomas!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.83,0:59:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉实在抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.12,0:59:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 这是紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, this is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.38,0:59:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.22,0:59:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 最好是重要的事, 我只是. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? This better be important. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.15,0:59:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你在滑雪吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you skiing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.16,0:59:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是在滑雪, 但我现在急需你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snowboarding, actually. But I need your help now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.41,0:59:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,生死攸关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life or death situation this very second.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.80,0:59:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你用我给你的戒指来救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to use the ring I gave you to save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.93,0:59:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.13,0:59:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 慢点说, 我都不知道你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, slow down. I don't even know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.43,0:59:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需要想象一下, 你想让戒指指指向哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gotta picture where you want the ring to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.59,0:59:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,快想象一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So picture this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.58,1:00:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 天哪, 好的, 好的, 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. Okay, okay. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.77,1:00:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.12,1:00:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是你扔的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you throw it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.32,1:00:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦 天哪 -什么? 告诉我"哦天哪"是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, god. - What? Tell me what "oh, god. "
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.52,1:00:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我逗乔乔的时候把戒指弄混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mixed up the rings when I was teasing jojo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.55,1:00:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 那它在哪儿? 那它在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where is it then? Where is it then?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.37,1:00:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.55,1:00:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道, 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.78,1:00:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I very much want to know,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.25,1:00:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在我变成刺猬口味的雪糕之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I become a hedgehog-flavored snow cone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.91,1:00:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住, 伙计, 我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang tight, buddy. I got this.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.89,1:00:35.86,Note,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.92,1:00:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,有了这个戒指, 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this ring, Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.31,1:00:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.02,1:00:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧, 伙计?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay, bud?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.54,1:00:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-没有 -你在干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not really. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.80,1:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这听起来可能有点疯狂, 但我需要看一下那个戒指, 就一秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna sound crazy, but I need to see that ring for just one second, one second.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.63,1:00:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗? -我保证马上还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you lost your mind? - I'm gonna give it right back, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.31,1:00:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托, 兰德尔, 这真的很重要 -不, 兄弟  去坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, Randall, it's really important. - No, bro. Go sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.01,1:00:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请把戒指给我? -兰德尔, 别看他, 看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the ring, please? - Randall, don't look at him, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.80,1:00:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,兰德尔·兰德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randall, Randall.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.38,1:00:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1秒  -把戒指戴在我手指上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One second. - Put the ring on my finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.04,1:00:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不, 兰德尔, 听我说 -兰德尔! 看着我  我手上的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Randall, listen to me. - Randall! Look at me. Ring on my finger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.09,1:01:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我戒指! 只是一秒  -给它戴上戒指!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me the ring! Just one second. - Put a ring on it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.57,1:01:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的? 可以吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, love? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.03,1:01:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,与这枚戒指…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With this ring...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.77,1:01:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的, 宝贝  -我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, baby. - I'm so sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.95,1:01:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-雪, 我的天  -哦, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Snow, my god. - Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.07,1:01:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.95,1:01:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.58,1:01:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,-索尼克! -夏威夷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sonic! - Hawaii.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.71,1:01:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.83,1:01:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事情了? 摔疼吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.87,1:01:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不, 不, 不, 我没事 -好吧, 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, I'm fine. - Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.18,1:01:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-这下你有大麻烦了! -好吧, 你冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because you're in so much trouble! - Okay, you calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.53,1:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.95,1:01:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好的, 快速的版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, quick version.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.45,1:01:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,机器蛋人回来了, 他在找魔法翡翠绿宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotnik is back on earth and he's after a magic emerald.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.78,1:01:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把它拿回来, 不然世界就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get it back or the world is doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.03,1:01:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.06,1:02:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-等等! 这一切都是昨天发生的吗? -等等, 尾巴是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! All this happened since yesterday? - Wait. Who's tails?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.82,1:02:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 你能听到我讲话吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.39,1:02:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊, 现在有两个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, lord, there are two of them now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.99,1:02:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 让我想想, 让我想想  尾巴, 快醒醒, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, let me think, let me think. Tails, come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.97,1:02:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.90,1:02:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,兰德尔, 为什么你所有的朋友都有武器?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randall, why do all of your friends have weapons?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.10,1:02:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,沃卓斯基夫妇, 你们真该邀请我一起吃早午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really should have taken me up on that brunch, Mr. and Mrs. Wachowski.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.87,1:02:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,橄榄园的家伙吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Olive garden guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.91,1:02:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的, 各位, 我们是联邦特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, everyone. We're federal agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.83,1:02:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是, 探员, 执行你的任务吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too, agent. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.28,1:02:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说整个婚礼都是个圈套?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean to tell me that this entire wedding was a setup?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.45,1:02:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,-瑞秋 等一下 -什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rachel, wait a minute. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.32,1:02:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错, 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's correct, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.27,1:02:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,"鲶鱼行动"的每个方面全都是捏造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single aspect of operation catfish was a complete fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.95,1:02:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,鲇鱼行动?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Operation catfish?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.20,1:02:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这里每个人都是特工吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is everyone here an agent?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.19,1:02:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是特工吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you an agent?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.31,1:02:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.91,1:02:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那个花商也是特工吗? 那摄影师呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the florist an agent? How about the photographer?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.87,1:03:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,给我脱毛的那个女人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The woman who waxed my...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.37,1:03:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在水疗中心?\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the spa?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.25,1:03:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 乔乔(小女孩)难道也是是特工吗? -瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is jojo an agent? - Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.08,1:03:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么? -瑞秋, 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Rachel, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.21,1:03:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想听! 我不要听!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done listening! I am done listening!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.82,1:03:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉, 我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.94,1:03:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am. I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.89,1:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 嘿, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Hey, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.57,1:03:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他! 嘿!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.62,1:03:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.83,1:03:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-冷静别这么做 -汤姆!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it easy. It's not worth it. - Tom!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.91,1:03:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克没有威胁性, 他是我们这边的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic is not a threat. He's on our side.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.62,1:03:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个不受控制的外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an uncontrolled extraterrestrial.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.57,1:03:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你协助教唆他的日子结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your days of aiding and abetting him are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.41,1:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,在直升机到达之前, 把他们关在酒店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure them in the hotel until the chopper arrives.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.20,1:03:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你犯了个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.53,1:03:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你等着, 混蛋特工!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, major a-hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.82,1:03:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是我的大喜日子,\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is still my day,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.71,1:03:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,得有人给我解释清楚这到底是怎么回事!\N{\fnArial\fs30}And someone is gonna explain to me what the hell is going on here!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.23,1:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,旧金山事件之后成立了一个全球特遣部队,\N{\fnArial\fs30}After the events in San Francisco, a global task force was created,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.94,1:03:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,致力于保护我们的星球免受外星人的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devoted to protecting our planet from alien threats.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.83,1:04:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那一天, 国家守护单位诞生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day, guardian units of nations was born.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.90,1:04:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-G-U-N, 掏枪至于吗? -枪, 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- G-u-n. Seriously? - Gun, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.42,1:04:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,听着, 保若护我们的星球不受机器人博士的伤害如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, what about protecting our planet from Dr. Robotnik?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.24,1:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人早就死了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotnik is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.62,1:04:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不对, 他又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong. He's back.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.90,1:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,而你却把唯一能阻止他的人都带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just hauled away the only ones who could stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.42,1:04:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,听说机器博士人又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like robotnik might be back in play.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.26,1:04:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是的话, 马上找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he is, I want him found immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.93,1:04:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,取消我橄榄园五点的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cancel my five o'clock at the olive garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.88,1:04:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-玛迪阿姨? -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Aunt maddie? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.37,1:04:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克和他的朋友丢下了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic and his friend dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.97,1:04:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.38,1:04:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我想和我未婚夫说句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to have a word with my fiance.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.68,1:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那个词就是"谋杀"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that word is "murder. "
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.70,1:04:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 来吧  你不能把我们留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on. You can't just leave us in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.82,1:04:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友受伤了! 他需要医生, 兽医!\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend is hurt! He needs a doctor, a vet, anyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.41,1:04:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 你得醒醒了, 伙计  快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails, you got to wake up, buddy. Please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.80,1:05:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.28,1:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Game plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.95,1:05:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我进入酒店, 找到他们关押汤姆和索尼克的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get inside the hotel and find where they're hiding Tom and Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.64,1:05:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 那我去找兰德尔, 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Then I find Randall, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.62,1:05:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我掐住他让他无法呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I squeeze the breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.74,1:05:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在已经经历了很多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going through a lot right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.46,1:05:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我自己来处理好吗? -当然当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So let me process this my own way, okay? - Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.20,1:05:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-没意见  -应该带本日记夹来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No judgment. - Should've brought a journal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.80,1:05:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.42,1:05:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 这是用来当武器的吗, 太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Is this meant to be a weapon? This is adorable.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.10,1:05:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝这个, 兰德尔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that, Randall!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.92,1:05:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑啊, 兰德尔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Randall!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.45,1:05:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好了啦!\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.22,1:05:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们马上就知道了结果了 -好吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're about to find out. - All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.08,1:05:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去找点乐子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go kick some Booty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.08,1:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋! 不, 瑞秋!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel! No. Rachel!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.82,1:06:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.90,1:06:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,站住!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.37,1:06:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,拿家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.08,1:06:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他会回来的, 对吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna come back down, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.37,1:06:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,难说.\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.99,1:06:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.44,1:06:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听着, 汤姆和索尼克肯定在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Tom and Sonic have to be inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.20,1:06:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去收拾未婚妻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a fiance to vaporize.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.07,1:06:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小心背后妹妹 -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch your back, sis. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.71,1:06:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,兰德尔!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randall!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.13,1:06:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到她了, 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got her. Move in.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.63,1:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.15,1:07:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是故意的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not mean to do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.91,1:07:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么烦心事吗, 探员?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something bothering you, agent?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.31,1:07:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是对瑞秋做的事有点内疚, 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just feel a little guilty about what I did to Rachel, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.74,1:07:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心, 我们会送她一张礼品卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it. We'll send her a gift card.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.07,1:07:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,兰德尔! 现在, 我提议干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I propose a toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.48,1:07:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一次完美的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a perfectly executed operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.02,1:07:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,长官, 我们遭到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we're under attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.95,1:08:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,兰德尔, 你老婆回来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Randall, wifey's home!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.15,1:08:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊, 瑞秋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.46,1:08:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个好女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.40,1:08:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个渣男\N{\fnArial\fs30}You no-good,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.77,1:08:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,卑鄙, 肮脏, 谎话连篇. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lowdown, dirty, lying...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.08,1:08:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 先听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.25,1:08:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,只有变态的人才会骗别人去办假婚礼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of twisted sicko tricks someone into a fake wedding?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.95,1:09:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,派对结束了, 新娘哥斯拉, 呆在那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party's over, bridezilla. Stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.74,1:09:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个狗娘养的. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.87,1:09:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你试试 -不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have it your way. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.00,1:09:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.67,1:09:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真令人失望, 兰德尔探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very disappointing, agent handel.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.78,1:09:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是武器吗? -我不知道, 但实验鉴真假\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that supposed to be a weapon? - I don't know, but we gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.29,1:09:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天惹的麻烦还不够多吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you caused enough trouble for one day?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.71,1:09:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没开始惹麻烦呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't even begun causing trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.92,1:09:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱的怒火比都不上新娘的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell hath no fury like a bride scorned.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.74,1:09:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看来像是真的, 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like it's real, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.24,1:09:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,别动, 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.52,1:09:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,讲真的, 被击中会有多糟?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be honest. How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.59,1:09:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,糟不到哪里去, 你被电击了, 不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad at all. You got tased. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.86,1:10:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-我好冷 -你掉到我们的冰雕上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so cold. - You landed on our ice sculpture.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.61,1:10:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.62,1:10:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.19,1:10:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就告诉我一次真相吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me the truth, for once.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.26,1:10:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我之间还有有什么事是真实的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything about you or about us that was real?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.20,1:10:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋, 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rachel, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.78,1:10:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在我遇见你之前, 我甚至不敢想象我有资格获得真正的幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I met you, I didn't think that I was even capable of real happiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.12,1:10:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但当你走进我的生活, 一切都改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that all changed when you walked into my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.57,1:10:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我违反了卧底工作的第一条规则\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ended up breaking the first rule of undercover work.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.03,1:10:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.16,1:10:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不要坠入爱河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.70,1:10:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玛迪 -我们要逃出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maddie! - We're busting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.44,1:10:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么通过守卫的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get past the guards?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.65,1:10:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那只小狐狸包里有一些疯狂的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that little fox is into some crazy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.79,1:10:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.34,1:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们走吧 -你真了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - You're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.66,1:11:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那些猫头鹰真傻, 它们真以为能把这地方藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The owls were fools to think they could hide this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.78,1:11:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.49,1:11:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,稍等片刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.78,1:12:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒, 我找到了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Eureka!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.25,1:12:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've found it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.40,1:12:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.53,1:12:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么?  -一个大问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - A big problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.32,1:12:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,罗盘指引机器人博士找到了绿宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The compass led robotnik to the emerald.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.24,1:12:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那肯定有几百英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's got to be hundreds of miles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.78,1:12:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 集合, 我们来想个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Huddle up. Let's figure out a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.47,1:12:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一起 -没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Together. - There's no time for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.49,1:12:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我是唯一一个能够尽快赶到那里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one that can get there fast enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.51,1:12:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 你一个人做不了这么大的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, this is way too big for you to do by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.97,1:12:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到那边那只小狐狸了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that little fox over there?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.01,1:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他穿越整个宇宙来见他的英雄(我)\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came all the way across the universe to meet his hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.01,1:13:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,-然而他的英雄做了什么? -我差点害死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what did his hero do? - I practically got him killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.87,1:13:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗? 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.37,1:13:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的责任降临了, 但我搞砸了, 我不是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}My moment came and I blew it. I'm no hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.27,1:13:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等 -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.32,1:13:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让任何人因为我而受到伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not letting anyone else get hurt because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.74,1:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,趁现在还来得及, 我要把这事解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fix this while I still can.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.20,1:13:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.91,1:13:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 等等!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.01,1:13:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点, 小心点, 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Hold on. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.03,1:13:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别动, 别动 -放轻松, 小家伙, 你受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move. Don't move. - Take it easy, little guy. You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.71,1:13:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们必须帮他, 你不知道他面对的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to help him. You don't know what he's up against.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.55,1:13:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在相信我们了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe us now?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.99,1:13:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 鲍勃!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bob!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.08,1:13:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,玛丽亚, 你好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Maria, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.57,1:13:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我在练习舞步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working on my moves.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.60,1:13:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,保持绿色出行, 无需开车烧汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keepin' it green. No need to burn the fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.24,1:14:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,说到汽油燃料. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of fuel...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.77,1:14:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,门关了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closed?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.71,1:14:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.04,1:14:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.29,1:14:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.74,1:14:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,改造, 改造  看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makeover, makeover. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.39,1:14:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不许动! 警察!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Police!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.12,1:14:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊, 你的手像机器人, 你的手像机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god, you got robot hands. You got robot hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.57,1:14:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是, 这是手套 -把手举起来手指张开!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, they're gloves. - Get 'em up. Now spread your fingers!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.06,1:14:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,现在动起来! 挥动起来!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now wiggle 'em! Wiggle your digits!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.99,1:14:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没错! 就像你刚刚指挥音乐剧那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Like you just finished a big musical number.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.49,1:14:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.12,1:14:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你头上怎么有盏灯?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is there a light on your head?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.47,1:15:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我是这个周末的治安官, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm the sheriff for the weekend, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.62,1:15:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.88,1:15:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么非得是水?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did it have to be water?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.92,1:15:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 你能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.89,1:15:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,得足够快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.47,1:17:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想这样毫无意义的死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to die like this! It's derivative!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.23,1:17:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给爸爸让个路!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make room for daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.60,1:17:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,两全其美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two and two.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.76,1:17:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了, 我们还是两足动物, 差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great! We're still bipedals, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.80,1:17:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,洞里着火了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.14,1:17:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经解决了, 每隔七秒就有一个陷阱. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've solved it. There is a booby trap every seven seco...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.07,1:17:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那有点早\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a little early.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.98,1:17:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴它没把我的胡子刮掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So glad it didn't cut off my mustache.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.88,1:17:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 小红球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little red wrecking ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.87,1:17:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你很想戴上绿宝石,\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're dying to get your emerald on,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.20,1:17:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们能不能注意一下周围的环境?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can we be a little bit more mindful of our surroundings?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.49,1:17:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.19,1:18:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,30英尺后左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 30 feet, turn left.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.80,1:18:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要聪明的做事情而不是光靠努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work smarter, not harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.06,1:18:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的屁儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pelvis.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.93,1:18:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,好了, 秘密寺庙, 让我们看看你有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, secret temple, let's see what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.38,1:18:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 不! 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.65,1:18:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.74,1:18:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.70,1:19:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经到达目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have arrived at your destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.71,1:19:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哇, 这里面还真有个空间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. That really opened up the space.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.79,1:19:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信它还有一堵坚不可摧的墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't even picture it with an impenetrable wall now.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.82,1:19:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,碎裂的感觉总是让人很爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rubble is always a nice touch.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.01,1:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,终于来了, 翡翠大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last. The master emerald.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.78,1:19:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,终极力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ultimate power.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.03,1:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会恢复秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon order will be restored.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.99,1:19:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切都是因为我们合作得井井有条\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because of what we have done together.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.37,1:19:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,多么可贵的情谊啊, 纳克尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a lovely sentiment, knuckles.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.23,1:19:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉我有点感动得掉眼泪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I feel a single tear forming.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.70,1:19:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可悲的是. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sadly...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.88,1:19:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你对我来说就是通往(软饼干歌手)演唱会的门票工具而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're as useful to me now as a backstage pass to limp bizkit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.41,1:20:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.10,1:20:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙为什么总是想搞破坏!\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy is always trying to spoil a bad thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.57,1:20:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也来了? 走了很远的路对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are here, too? Took the long way, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.32,1:20:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,对你来说什么都是笑话吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything a joke to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.34,1:20:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你总是干涉我的使命?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why must you constantly interfere with my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.64,1:20:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我的使命是保护我的朋友和家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my destiny is to protect my friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.54,1:20:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我刚刚已经说过了(总爱搞破坏)\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I just threw up in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.09,1:20:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想要翡翠宝石, 你得先过我这一关\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you want that emerald, you're gonna have to go through me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.77,1:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,今天针鼹不留活口!\N{\fnArial\fs30}The echidna's taking no prisoners today!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.06,1:21:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克有勇气, 但他会一败涂地他能活下去吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic has heart, but will he lose the quill to live?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.43,1:21:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想和你打架, 但你没给我太多选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to fight you, but you're not giving me much choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.74,1:21:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太简单了, 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too easy. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.45,1:21:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么不站着, 光荣地死去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stand still and die with honor?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.20,1:21:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.59,1:21:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我考虑了一下, 然后就放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I thought about it and I pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.69,1:22:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊, 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi there, beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.46,1:22:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来很真实, 不是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the real deal, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.07,1:22:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我这一辈子都在找你, 你都去哪儿了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been all my life?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.53,1:22:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,说再见吧, 刺猬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say goodbye, hedgehog.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.32,1:22:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,纳克尔斯, 住手, 机器人在偷翡翠宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knuckles, stop. Robotnik's stealing the emerald!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.28,1:22:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你当我傻吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of fool do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.89,1:22:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你只管转过去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.62,1:22:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.20,1:22:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,等等, 我们说好的, 你不能这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! That wasn't the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.37,1:22:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你这可怜又天真的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You poor, naive creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.08,1:22:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.59,1:22:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,一个厉害的智者, 在一英里外就应该看到这个结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}A more advanced intellect would have seen this move coming a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.28,1:22:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,或者1. 6公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or 1. 6 kilometers.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.35,1:22:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但我一直相信你, 你是我的朋友!\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I trusted you! You were my friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.45,1:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 我突然觉得很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. That just hit me funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.81,1:23:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让这成为我给你上的最后一课吧, 你这个愚蠢的太空豪猪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let this be my final lesson to you, you dim-witted celestial skin tag.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.87,1:23:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友们. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.33,1:23:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,开放的, 诚实的, 但也很脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are open, honest and vulnerable with each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.41,1:23:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是 x 的平方乘以 y 的斜边,\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means x squared times the hypotenuse of y squared,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.17,1:23:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,除以友谊的绝对价值, 等于. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divided by the absolute value of friendship, equals...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.37,1:23:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,杜奇! (一张专辑)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dookie!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.68,1:23:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,噢, 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.90,1:23:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,混乱就是力量!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chaos is power!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.83,1:23:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这里!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.49,1:24:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,纳克尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knuckles!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.16,1:24:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,又是水? 拜托!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water again? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.57,1:25:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你救了我 -别跟我说话我没心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You saved me. - Don't talk to me. I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.16,1:25:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能在我伤心的时候攻击我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you attack me in my hour of sorrow!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.10,1:25:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要救我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you save me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.31,1:25:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你先救了我,\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you saved me first,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.46,1:25:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很显然你就有了优先战术优势, 我却搞不懂为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which clearly gave you a tactical advantage I do not understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.13,1:25:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是战术, 是我不能让你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't a tactic. I couldn't just let you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.87,1:25:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么? 一见面我就想干掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? I've been trying to destroy you since the moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.81,1:25:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因为当英雄不是只顾着自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because being a hero isn't about taking care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.70,1:25:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,而是要懂得为他人承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about taking responsibility for other people.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.41,1:25:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,智慧之语, 一句古老的地球谚语吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wise words. An ancient earth proverb?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.74,1:26:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 先生, 这是瓦乔夫斯基家族的名言\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, that's a wachowski family special.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.24,1:26:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,从一个坐小船的人那里得到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it from a guy in a rowboat.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.95,1:26:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一个对我很重要的人(甜甜圈主人)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who means a lot to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.41,1:26:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等等, 那是什么声音?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.16,1:26:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,只有刺猬索尼克才需要这么大的救助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only Sonic the hedgehog needs rescuing this much.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.80,1:26:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那只狡猾的小狐狸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sly little fox!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.36,1:26:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧, 傻瓜, 我们还没输呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, knucklehead. We're not beat yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.41,1:26:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在山上, 你告诉我你失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the mountain, you told me you'd lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.58,1:26:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.16,1:26:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但你看起来总是充满阳光, 自由自在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you seem so hopeful and free.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.91,1:26:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,无视失败, 你是如何做到迎难而上的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you move forward despite failing again?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.24,1:26:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一次又一次的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And again. And again. And again. And again.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.60,1:26:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我没失败那么多, 但我不是一个人做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I didn't fail that much. But I didn't do this all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.35,1:26:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了新的家庭, 新的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found a new family. New friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.11,1:26:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你也可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you can too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.88,1:26:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会再孤单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to be alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.03,1:26:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你这握手是认真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me with that handshake?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.88,1:27:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再玩游戏了, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done playing games, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.97,1:27:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你得告诉我, 我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna tell me what I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.19,1:27:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我最后一次问你. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am asking you for the last time...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.83,1:27:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你想在百吉饼上加点什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you like on your bagel?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.54,1:27:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不会告诉你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not telling you anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.29,1:27:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个百吉饼模型\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is a display bagel.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.37,1:27:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我真搞不懂你! 我是说, 我什么都试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it with you! I mean, I've tried everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.66,1:27:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,当好警察, 当坏警察, 还当给你百吉饼的警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was good cop. I was bad cop. I was cop who offers you a bagel.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.37,1:27:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都没有, 就像. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing. It's like...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.48,1:27:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个作展示百吉饼模型, 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a display bagel. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.00,1:27:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,博士, 你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.70,1:27:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是的, 我来了, 但我. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm here, and yet i'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.95,1:27:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不全在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.86,1:27:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,老大, 你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, are you feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.23,1:27:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm more than okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.03,1:28:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我升级了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm upgraded.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.24,1:28:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,邪恶3. 0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sinister 3. 0.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.37,1:28:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的游戏升级了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My game is next level.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.72,1:28:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.54,1:28:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我能闻到电波的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can smell the electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.62,1:28:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你闻起来像个小吃盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell like a snack plate.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.20,1:28:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊, 这说得过去, 我今天喝了两杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's fair. I had a couple today.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.87,1:28:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.99,1:28:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,坐在椅子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.48,1:28:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没做奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.87,1:28:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他明明坐在椅子上, 而我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause he, 'cause he was in the chair, so I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.33,1:28:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.03,1:28:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老大, 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir? We have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.78,1:29:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-所有小队就位! -建立防线!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All teams in position! - Set up a perimeter!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.91,1:29:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,走! 走! 走!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.84,1:29:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有什么麻烦, 我信赖的仆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incorrectus, my trusty barnacle.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.58,1:29:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年过去了,\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all these years,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.70,1:29:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于得到了. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I finally got...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.58,1:29:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一个答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is a solution.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.24,1:29:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-指挥官 -汇报情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Commander. - Status report.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.20,1:29:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人博士和斯通还和一个人质在里面, 人质可能是当地警方人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotnik is in there with stone and a hostage. Possibly local pd.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.66,1:29:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说他蠢但如果他是当地警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying he's dumb, but if he is local pd,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.12,1:29:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个镇子有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This town's in a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.53,1:29:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-韦德 -韦德(多半是韦德)\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wade. - Wade.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.23,1:30:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.17,1:30:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,摇滚新春系列, 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rockin' that new spring collection, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.86,1:30:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是糕点大王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it isn't the pastry king.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.41,1:30:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是甜甜圈领主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The donut lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.03,1:30:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的天才应该记得人家的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real genius would remember the name of the guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.10,1:30:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你敢破坏青山, 我还会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll do it again if you mess with green hills.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.95,1:30:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜你暂时的优越感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations on your oh-so-temporary sense of superiority.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.11,1:30:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你完蛋了, 机器人! 你的一切机械已被我们扣押\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're finished, robotnik! We've taken everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.43,1:30:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的实验室, 你的无人机, 甚至你的资金!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lab, your drones, your funding!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.41,1:30:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们看看你没有那些沙雕的机器人, 你还能有多强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how big of a man you are without your silly little robots.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.99,1:30:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你想看看. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to see...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.36,1:30:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我能成为多大的男人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big a man I can be?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.37,1:31:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到新的秩序世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the new norm.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.83,1:31:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊!\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.13,1:31:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,博士, 带我一起走吧!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor! Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.20,1:31:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他把所有东西都拆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking everything apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.89,1:31:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,像是在造什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's building something.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.10,1:31:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这阵仗只有一个原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can only be one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.73,1:32:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,翡翠宝石的力量很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fearsome power of the emerald.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.08,1:32:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那家伙把思想转变为现实能量, 我们就有大麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that thing really turns thoughts into power, we are in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.16,1:32:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人博士有很多坏念头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotnik has a lot of bad thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.40,1:32:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 索尼克, 你确定把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sonic, are you sure it was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.92,1:32:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,纳克尔斯其实不是坏人, 只是失去了理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knuckles isn't really a bad guy. He's just a little mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.75,1:32:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有搞混淆!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not mixed up!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.88,1:32:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我有钢铁般的意志力, 而且我有很多优点不像某些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have steely focus. And I'm complex. And that's a lot for some people.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.25,1:32:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你不是还在因我开车撞你而生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you're not still mad I hit you with that car.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.62,1:32:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我就没有受伤啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was completely uninjured.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.45,1:32:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我要在你最意想不到的时候复仇, 臭狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my revenge will come when you least expect it, fox.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.08,1:33:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,先生, 你真了不起!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you're magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.95,1:33:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你, 马屁精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sycophant.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.18,1:33:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你的崇拜是应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your admiration is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.40,1:33:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.91,1:33:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就像绵花糖鬼(捉鬼敢死队)一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the stay puft marshmallow man.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.51,1:33:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"征服世界"播放列表…\N{\fnArial\fs30}World domination playlist.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.08,1:33:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.45,1:33:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退! 快! 撤退!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back! Quick! Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.28,1:33:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么打败这玩意儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to beat this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.45,1:33:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.58,1:33:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,纳克尔斯, 用你的力量. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knuckles, use your strength to...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.20,1:33:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就从飞机上跳下去了, 哇!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump off the plane. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.62,1:34:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我们这样做, 第一步: 光电嘲讽机器人博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is what we're gonna do. Step 1: Light taunting.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.54,1:34:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,第二步: 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step 2: I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.66,1:34:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.02,1:34:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不错的玩偶, 蛋人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice action figure, eggman.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.83,1:34:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么鸟用, 还不是跟个丑八怪一样站在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it do anything or just stand there looking ugly?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.37,1:34:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟"水泡"一样, 这丫反复的来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a blister, he keeps coming back!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.13,1:34:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他在猎杀名单上l, 放个导弹, 做个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on the okay-to-kill list. Shoot the missiles. Make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.37,1:34:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要点时间, 先生, 我正在想办法如何操作这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a moment, sir. I'm trying to figure out how to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.30,1:34:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有看说明书吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you even glance at a manual?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.30,1:34:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-不! -我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.57,1:34:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,原谅我的闪电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon my lightning.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.13,1:34:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好把自己关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to ground yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.31,1:34:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把它像辣椒罐头一样打开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna pop that thing open like a can of chili...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.20,1:34:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.05,1:35:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-耶! -差一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Close one.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.06,1:35:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.13,1:35:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotnik!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.38,1:35:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,骗子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deceiver!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.66,1:35:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧, 死蚊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die, mosquito.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.24,1:35:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.03,1:35:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.50,1:35:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这是胡子捣碎机, 说明书上有写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the stache masher. Right here in the manual.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.05,1:35:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快递返回给发件人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to sender.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.18,1:36:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,斯通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stone?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.87,1:36:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很好, 接下来, 就会有报道说, 工作环境不友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Next thing you know, there'll be a report about a hostile work environment.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.14,1:36:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚已经是最好的攻击方式了, 但他毫发无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were our best attacks, and they did nothing!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.43,1:36:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,只要机器人有绿宝石, 我们就打不过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't beat robotnik as long as he's got that emerald.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.07,1:36:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他太强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.33,1:36:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,听着, 我们不够强大, 不能靠自己打败机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we aren't strong enough to beat robotnik on our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.32,1:36:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们有三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's three of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.82,1:36:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你的力量, 你的智慧和我的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your strength, your smarts and my speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.08,1:36:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,一起, 这样我们才能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together. That's how we win.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.21,1:36:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要一起在战场上叱咤风云\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we make our stand here on the field of battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.53,1:36:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,成为一个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a team.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.18,1:36:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.70,1:36:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.41,1:36:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,该战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.40,1:36:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不得不说, 实际上我没有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad time to say this, but I don't actually have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.88,1:36:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,尾巴, 有什么主意吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tails, any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.78,1:37:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得找到他的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to find his weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.53,1:37:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我建议攻击它裆部\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest the groin.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.16,1:37:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什么? 不, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.36,1:37:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,理论上, 没错的, 裆部是最脆弱的部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traditionally, yes, the groin is the weakest spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.08,1:37:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,别再说"裆部"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop saying "groin. "
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.25,1:37:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,刺猬!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hedgehog!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.21,1:37:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,小心!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.27,1:37:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他的弱点是什么, 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what his weak spot is. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.78,1:37:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是他的弱点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the groin!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.36,1:37:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,想想, 我快速到那家伙的脑子里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it. I live rent-free in this dude's head.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.24,1:37:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我去激怒他. .\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if I go out there and rile him up...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.21,1:37:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他会把注意力集中在你身上, 把他自本体暴露出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll focus on only you, leaving himself open.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.03,1:37:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,刺猬, 你是一个勇敢而高贵的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hedgehog, you are a brave and noble warrior.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.87,1:37:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,光荣地死去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your certain death with honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.56,1:37:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们得学学你鼓舞人心的语言了, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to work on your pep talks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.26,1:37:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的   - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.83,1:37:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, mustache.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.52,1:37:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要我? 来抓我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me? Come and get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.81,1:37:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用告诉我"来"和"抓"\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't tell me about coming and getting.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.16,1:37:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在来抓你得路上!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am on the cutting edge of coming and getting!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.54,1:37:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来了, 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, getting.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.40,1:38:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来了, 来了, 来了, 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, getting. Coming, getting. Coming, getting.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.77,1:38:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.58,1:38:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为我百分之百是个肌肉男\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's because I am one million percent muscle.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.58,1:38:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快跟上, 狐狸!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, fox!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.58,1:38:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-快! 快! 大家退后! -快走, 就这样! 快, 快, 快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Move, guys! Move back! - Let's go, that's it! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:15.98,1:38:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-继续跑! -跑! 跑!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep going! - Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.04,1:38:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-不不! 停下! -停车!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no! Stop! - Stop the truck!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.96,1:38:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,汤姆, 这里发生了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.37,1:38:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-你和我想的一样? -我们去找我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You thinking what I'm thinking? - Let's get our kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.76,1:38:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-我们需要你的卡车 -我们需要你的卡车!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need your truck! - We need your truck!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.98,1:38:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,来! 抓!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming, getting.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.21,1:38:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,计划是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the plan here?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.84,1:38:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要造个大机器人房子? 给自己找个大机器人老婆?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna build a big robot house? Get yourself a big robot wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.12,1:38:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我要奴役人类, 让他们效忠于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to enslave humanity and force them to service my machines.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.94,1:38:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,先是青山, 然后是宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, green hills. Then the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.38,1:38:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是多元宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the multiverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.78,1:38:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢? 也许这就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who knows? Maybe that'll be enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.16,1:38:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够公开么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full disclosure?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.38,1:39:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会想呆在那儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.99,1:39:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,激光眼? 开玩笑呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eye lasers? Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.14,1:39:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,鼻涕火箭!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snot rocket!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.62,1:39:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不! 不, 不, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.16,1:39:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这就放弃了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving up already?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.00,1:39:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当你和比你大700倍的人打时, 就不那么强悍了, 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so tough when you're fighting someone 700 times your size, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.62,1:39:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你打不过我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't beat me!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.37,1:39:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我无所不知, 无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all-powerful! All-knowing!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.08,1:39:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界都看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All-seeing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.21,1:39:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你的机器人出了点小故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like your fancy robot has a glitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.82,1:39:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是我吗? 那我呢? 我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it me? What about me? I'm over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.62,1:39:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,上面! 下面! 后面!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up top! Down below! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.07,1:40:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里, 抱歉, 这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm over here. Sorry! Over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.68,1:40:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太慢了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.91,1:40:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-你不可能比我聪明 -又错过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't outsmart me. - Missed me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.95,1:40:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我比你聪明多了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the outsmarter-er!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.24,1:40:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有比你聪明, 我只是分散注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't outsmart you. I'm just the distraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.20,1:40:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robotnik!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.04,1:40:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是一个全息图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am also a hologram.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.00,1:40:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不忠诚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disloyal.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.99,1:40:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,," dis"是我的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dis" is how I roll.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.32,1:40:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我的翡翠宝石呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my emerald?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.57,1:40:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不, 不! 不, 不, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.87,1:40:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑, 备用电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, auxiliary power.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.16,1:41:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,翡翠宝石, 就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emerald. It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.26,1:41:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走开, 你这个垃圾!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, you hunk of junk!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.82,1:41:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我得拿到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to reach it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.21,1:41:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快, 快, 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.51,1:41:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿! 快! 快, 快, 快!\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is! Go! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.66,1:41:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.74,1:42:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧你了, 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got you, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.27,1:42:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,注意了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.66,1:42:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-你们没事吧? -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You guys okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.46,1:42:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.91,1:42:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我拿到了翡翠宝石, 我们还是能打败他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got the emerald. We could still defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.18,1:42:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托, 拜托, 这东西怎么用? 我该怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. How does this thing work? What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.62,1:42:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什么情况?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.24,1:42:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 不, 不, 不, 不! 不, 不, 不, 不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, no! No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.94,1:42:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这个幸福的小家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the happy little family.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.70,1:42:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你得离我远点, 我才是他要找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get away from me. I'm the one he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.42,1:42:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.07,1:42:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们哪儿也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.17,1:42:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.03,1:43:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,家人团结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And families stick together...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.55,1:43:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.83,1:43:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.87,1:43:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也爱你, 索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We love you too, Sonic.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.91,1:43:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.55,1:43:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我抓住他了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.02,1:43:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于搞定他了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finally got him!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.70,1:43:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.29,1:44:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,都结束了, 送鸡蛋的.\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over, egg-man.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.32,1:44:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,过去的就让它过去吧, 你觉得呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say we just let bygones be bygones?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.33,1:44:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我做了一些事, 你也做了一些事, 双方都有好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did some things, you did some things. There are good people on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.03,1:44:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是两个聪明的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely two intelligent beings.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.80,1:45:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-加油伙计加油 -干掉他索尼克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, buddy. Come on. - Get him, Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.16,1:45:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对, 干他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.70,1:45:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哦, 就这?\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.21,1:45:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 我们不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.74,1:45:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,回见, 仇人!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, hater!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.41,1:45:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-索尼克! -伙计!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sonic! - Buddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.45,1:45:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,等等! 你不能碰他!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! You cannot touch him!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.83,1:45:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,刺猬拥有翡翠的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hedgehog holds the power of the emerald.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.96,1:45:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起, 他已经不是你以前认识的索尼克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry. He is no longer the Sonic you once knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.09,1:45:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.10,1:46:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你得试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to try this.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.45,1:46:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧, 他依然是你们之前认识的那个索尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. He is exactly the Sonic you once knew.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.66,1:46:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-啊哈 -啊哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.59,1:46:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.04,1:46:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,放马过来吧, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in, bud.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.28,1:46:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能穿上蓝色的衣服真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to be back in blue.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.99,1:46:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,金色的穿上也很有趣, 但蓝色更适合我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golden god thing was fun, but blue has always been more my color.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.41,1:46:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿起来很好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks good on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.58,1:46:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 你是宇宙中最强大的英雄, 而你却放走他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, you were the most powerful hero in the universe, and you let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.29,1:46:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.95,1:47:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我还有很长的路要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I still have some growing up to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.28,1:47:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-我还挺喜欢当孩子的 -你不是一般的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I kind of like being a kid. - And you're not just any kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.70,1:47:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.58,1:47:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没错!\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.08,1:47:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-来吧 -抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring it in! - Yay. Hugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.72,1:47:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好我们上次没这么做, 不然你会被炸死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing we didn't do this before. You would've blown up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.45,1:47:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你把它修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fixed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.04,1:47:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我花了一辈子的时间来寻找这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've spent my whole life questing for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.45,1:47:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.99,1:47:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们也有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.70,1:47:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办? 接下来怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do with it? What next?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.37,1:47:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经有两个英雄阶层\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were once two orders of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.02,1:47:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们都去了天上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they have all passed on to the great battleground in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.18,1:47:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要建立一个新秩序, 我们三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we start a new order. The three of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.29,1:47:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不是轻松的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no light task.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.08,1:47:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须发誓要用我们的力量来保护宇宙的安全,\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must make a vow to use our powers to keep the universe safe,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.58,1:48:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,互相照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}To watch out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.70,1:48:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的新部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our new tribe.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.60,1:48:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.49,1:48:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-来个碰拳 -好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A power bump! - Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.96,1:48:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是地球的习俗, 一个不可违背的承诺\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an earth custom. An unbreakable promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.74,1:48:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.83,1:48:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那就来个碰拳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A power bump it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.42,1:48:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,碰拳!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power bump!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.99,1:48:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,今天真是青山打棒球的好日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's truly a beautiful day for baseball here in green hills.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.20,1:48:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的阵容很精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}An exciting lineup today.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.51,1:48:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在投手位置是来自银河系的新秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the mound, rookie sensation from across the galaxy,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.63,1:48:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,无敌尾巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miles "tails" prower,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.41,1:48:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,面对着得是超级发电站纳克尔斯, 针鼹鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Facing off against the powerhouse, knuckles the echidna.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.46,1:48:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啊不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.42,1:48:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我对敌人的球很愤怒?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I angry at the enemy ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.74,1:48:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你不必愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.92,1:48:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你只需尽力击球, 然后跑到球垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just want to hit it as hard as you can and then run around the bases.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.56,1:48:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我的任务在我所站的地方结束, 为什么还要跑呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if my quest ends where I am standing, why run at all?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.57,1:49:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我受不了这家伙  我为什么要跟他一组\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't with this guy. Why do I even try?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.12,1:49:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是个游戏, 我们在这里玩得开心就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a game. We're out here having fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.99,1:49:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只是找点乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just having some fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.69,1:49:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.20,1:49:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧! 给他点颜色看看, 尾巴!\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! Give him the heat, tails!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.74,1:49:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你准备好接受我的超快球了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you're ready for my fastball.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.63,1:49:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你的快球即将会被拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fastball will be dishonored.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.21,1:49:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一样, 狐狸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so will you, fox.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.20,1:49:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,-放松伙计们! -别想太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Easy, guys! - Don't think about it too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.99,1:49:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,抬起你的胳膊肘, 眼睛盯着球, 然后把它放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep your elbow up, eye on the ball and give it a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.54,1:49:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,旅行? 去哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ride? To where?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.08,1:49:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,能量碰碰! (碰拳)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power bump!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.72,1:49:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,胜利是我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victory is mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.18,1:49:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿, 不公平! 那不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no fair! That shouldn't count.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.66,1:49:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,一垒也是我的!\N{\fnArial\fs30}First base is also mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.46,1:49:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-我想那是我们唯一的球 -我已经征服了第二垒!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think that was our only ball. - I have conquered the second of the bases!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.74,1:49:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谁想吃冰淇淋?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.54,1:49:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,把盖子打掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knocked the cover off that.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.70,1:49:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-冰淇淋! -冰淇淋耶!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ice cream! - Ice cream, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:53.03,1:49:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在享受嗨皮! 什么是冰淇淋?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am having the fun! What is ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.83,1:49:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是甜点, 如果你享受乐趣, 你一定会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a dessert. If you like fun, you're gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.24,1:50:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃, 甜点, 里面有葡萄吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yum. Dessert. Does it have grapes in it?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.33,1:50:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 通常不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not usually.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.26,1:50:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我为我们的小家伙感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of our little guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.41,1:50:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的很喜欢他的新朋友, 尤其是那个红色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really like his new friends, especially the red one.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.95,1:50:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-他让我笑死了 -挥杆也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He cracks me up. - Heck of a swing too.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.67,1:50:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧, 狐狸, 我们的甜点之旅在等着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, fox. Our dessert adventure awaits.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.42,1:50:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,-干得好伙计们 -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good job, guys. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.92,1:50:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是, 宝贝, 我们去吃冰淇淋, 来吧, 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, baby. Let's go get some ice cream. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.45,1:50:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你感到高兴, 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy for you, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.62,1:50:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到了你的同类, 能一起成长的完美朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got your wingmen. Perfect friends to grow up with.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.87,1:50:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-来吧, 纳克尔斯 -我的胜利战车!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, knuckles. - My victory chariot!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.26,1:50:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我得到的远不止这些… 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a lot more than that... Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:41.67,1:50:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看谁先跑到卡车那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Race you to the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.57,1:50:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一, 二, 三, 开始!\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.66,1:50:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不, 别对我手下留情, 我要你尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't go easy on me. I want your best.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.88,1:50:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,索尼克, 我刚听说他们有糖果屑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonic, I have just been told they have sprinkles.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.91,1:50:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,冰淇淋和糖屑? 这就是你要去探索的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ice cream and sprinkles? This is your new destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.11,1:51:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一顿完美的晚餐, 来庆祝我击败你的一垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a perfect meal to celebrate my victory over you in base of ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.69,1:51:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么? -我是说你差点就打败我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I mean, you barely beat me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.96,1:51:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你从没被打得这么惨过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never been beaten so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.93,1:51:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不能忘记这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't forget this.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.49,1:53:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,探员, 我想知道最新情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent, I want an update.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.57,1:53:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还在搜索, 长官, 我们没有发现机器人的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still searching, sir. We haven't found any sign of robotnik.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.36,1:53:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能在次坠机中幸存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one could've survived that crash.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.79,1:53:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,他死翘翘了, 终于解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's toast. Good riddance.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.95,1:53:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真是被那个疯子搞得一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mess that lunatic made.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.46,1:53:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,长官, 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there's something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.71,1:53:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在机器人博士仓库里清楚数据时, 还发现了一些情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were wiping robotnik off our database, we found something.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.33,1:53:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,系统深处藏匿着大约50年前文件数据\N{\fnArial\fs30}A file buried deep in our system and dating back over 50 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.53,1:53:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-那是什么? -坐标, 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was it? - Coordinates, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.20,1:53:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,坐标? 什么坐标?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coordinates? To what?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.79,1:53:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一个绝密性研究机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}A secret research facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.39,1:53:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是个秘密基地, 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a black site, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.70,1:53:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有人费了很大劲把这个藏起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone worked very hard to keep this hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.54,1:53:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.70,1:53:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,启动暗影计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Project shadow.
